title: "luria-opal: audit material for an autonomous genome-mining campaign"
message: "If you use this material, please cite the manuscript."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "The authors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/omicverse/luria-opal"
license: CC-BY-4.0
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.23251666"
    description: "Working files deposited at Zenodo"
abstract: >-
  The ledger, source tables and independent recomputation scripts for a campaign
  in which the Luria multi-agent system surveyed 618,638,921 proteins, returned a
  negative result on its brief, and identified OPAL (PF11149, formerly DUF2924) as
  an operon-coupled accessory of large serine recombinases.
